  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When they unleash a killer move, piercing white light explodes into a giant light pillar that pierces the heavens, then descends; the grand white troops reappear in tight formation. They are foot soldiers, yet that move gives them mobility superior to black banner cavalry.",
      "chapters": [
